    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a12def38ea6f6397af8395dd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对她来说，这是最熟悉的一项德国“传统”。\n让她实际感受到自己已充分掌握这项传统，\n一定能替她增添自信的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c45c59dfab815c398dc1360b9eb2568cea2942e971d70d181fad7caa5b020681",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
