      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……的确，点心的制作方式里，\n包含了历代大师传承下来的传统呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffcf2b5a7584416d8bfd5542c1199e25954ce7750936cfd79e32bd29988e7938",
